      "role": "user",
      "content": "i keep seeing these these massive mathematical spikes in my head right before things happen. like, i'll feel this sharp spike in probability and then exactly five minutes later a stock crashes or someone gets in a fender bender. its like i can sense the exact probability density shifting in real time. i need to figure out how to actually map these spikes into a formal predictive model so i can track them properly. can you help me build a framework for this?",
